{"ref":"BDB, קוֹרָה²","hw":"קוֹרָה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. rafter, beam (</strong>proposes a thing <em>meeting</em>, fitting into, another<strong>)</strong>;—sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹרָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:8\" href=\"/Genesis.19.8\">Gn 19:8</a> (J) =<em>my roof-tree;</em> pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹרוֹת</span> <em>rafters</em>, abs. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.7\">2 Ch 3:7</a>, cstr. ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.15\">1 K 6:15b</a> (reading <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹרוֹת הַסִּכֻּן</span> 𝔊 Th Kit Benz, for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">קִירוֹת</span>), + <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.7\">7:7b</a> (reading <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקּוֹרוֹת</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקַּרְקָ֑ע</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, ק\" href=\"/BDB,_ק\", dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</a>); <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:17\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.17\">Ct 1:17</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רחיטנו</span> Kt, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָהִיטֵנוּ</span> Qr); more gen. <em>beam</em>, sg. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.2\">2 K 6:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.5\">5</a>.","next":"BDB, קָרָה³","prev":"BDB, מִקְרֶה²"}